<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine minister to announce loan package - source.</title>
<headline>Argentine minister to announce loan package - source.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine Economy Minister Roque Fernandez will announce Wednesday a package of loans for small business and a national housing plan which will mark &quot;new social times&quot;, a government source said.</p>
<p>Fernandez will announce the plan, which will be jointly financed by the state and private banks, in a speech closing a meeting of the Argentine Banking Association scheduled for 1900 local time/2200 GMT, the source said.</p>
<p>The announcement would come just three months before mid-term congressional elections.</p>
<p>((-- Patrick Adam, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
